  nodeID: 19
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - 'Your heart is stuck in your throat there for a second. '
  - 'It''s the perfect fantasy. '
  - Meet a cute girl that saves you from your boring job, you console her emotionally,
    then she asks for your phone number in the most casual way ever.
  - You pull out your phone (make sure she doesn't see your trembling fingers.)
  - 'Your voice sounds a little rugged as you press out the words:'
  - '"Sure. Do you want to take it in front of the deep fryer or the broken ice cream
    machine?"'
  character_img: {fileID: -5365129548077109440, guid: a60307d3026a28a4e85fc9b480851209, type: 3}
