  nodeID: 14
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: ???
  dialogText:
  - "\u201CNot usually. I\u2019m the one who bails, if we\u2019re doing full honesty.\u201D"
  - You relax as she seems to get your werid ass humor.
  - "She checks the phone\u2014still dead. Shrugs. No big deal."
  - "She \u201CBut tonight I figured\u2026 try something different. Show up. Stay.
    Be a responsible friend. Look how that worked out.\u201D She shrugs. \"No big
    deal.\""
  - "The phone\u2014still dead. She drums her fingers lightly on the counter next
    to you\u2014nervous energy disguised as casual rhythm."
  - "\u201CSo hey, since you asked...\" her tone shifts lighty. Although you're making
    light, the situation seems to have taken some out of her."
  - "If someone stands you up\u2014friend, date, whoever\u2014do you stick around?
    Or do you bolt the second it gets uncomfortable?\u201D"
  - "She says it like a joke, not realizing she\u2019s asking something personal.
    But there\u2019s curiosity under it\u2014like she\u2019s gathering intel on you
    for reasons she won\u2019t mention."
  character_img: {fileID: 3744488011480403688, guid: b31736dea710f7a40b90f2e7cb122101, type: 3}
  background_img: {fileID: 0}
  nodeQuestion: 0
