  nodeID: 16
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: ???
  dialogText:
  - "\u201CSteady\u2019s rare. People ghost at the first sign of awkward.\u201D She
    gives you a sideways look from the dead phone in her hands."
  - "So she didn't show for this party. Nothing wild. Just a party couple blocks
    over. Loud music, cheap drinks, too many strangers pretending they\u2019re having
    the best night of their lives.\""
  - '"Nothing much she missed out on. It still sucks being stood up."'
  - A short grimce of sorrow washes over her face. She looks a little tired and older
    in that moment.
  - "Her smile thins, just a little\u2014like a crack in the armor."
  character_img: {fileID: -926039197622087486, guid: 6e05be3d3d3015141b7f1b0a4bd0f1e2, type: 3}
