  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - You throw her a crooked glance and smile. "We'll I AM having an existential crisis
    right now."
  - '"But I have one every Saturday night I''m spending here, so I might as well
    serve you some food. What''s your order?"'
  - Zany sarcasm is how you get all the girls you have heard.
