  whostalking: ???
  dialogText:
  - '"No worries, I''m kidding. Please come over, I''d love someone to talk to."'
  - "\u201CGot it. If your boss shows up, I\u2019m stealing the register and holding
    you hostage with a spatula.\u201D"
  - "She steps behind the counter, careful not to bump into you, and plugs in her
    dead phone near the soda machine. She leans her hip against a metal prep table\u2014
    careful not to invading your space."
