  nodeID: 21
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: MC
  dialogText:
  - You have your phone ready. She leans in, head tilted toward yours, and smiles.
  - The distance between pockets and bodies narrows.
  - "Her hair brushes your cheek; She turns her head just enough that her lips are
    near your neck\u2014"
  - 'You see her face only in the small rectangle of your phone screen. Her half-closed
    eyes, her lips next to your neck. '
  - You feel the warm tingle of her breath.
  - She whispers:"...
  - Felix here. I don't know what she whispers yet...
  - 'The selfie camera clicks. '
