  nodeID: 25
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: Haru
  dialogText:
  - "\u201CAlright. Food\u2019s gonna get soggy. Thanks for the charger. And the
    selfie. And the\u2026 tragic ice cream machine backdrop.\u201D"
  - "She pulls her jacket straight, eyes already drifting toward the door like she\u2019s
    halfway gone.  No glowing smile. No dramatic goodbye. You clench a little there."
  - "\u201CTake care of yourself, okay? Night shifts eat people alive.\u201D"
  - She turns, steps out from behind the counter, pushing the door with her shoulder.
    The bell jingles.
  - 'No look back. Just one last, almost bored line tossed over her shoulder:'
  - "\u201CDon\u2019t text me something cringe. I\u2019ll block you.\u201D"
