  nodeID: 23
  teleportLocation: {fileID: 0}
  whostalking: Haru
  dialogText:
  - "\u201CYou know what\u2019s funny? You look at people like they\u2019re already
    leaving\u2026 even while they\u2019re standing in front of you.\u201D"
  - She finishes typing, taps the screen, and hands the phone back.
  - "She steps back behind the counter again, gathering her food bag and the folded
    flyer she set down earlier. She casually tucks the flyer into your chest pocket\u2014"
