  dialogText:
  - She laughs brighly.
  - "\u201CObviously the broken ice cream machine. It\u2019 matches my energy.\u201D"
  - "She steps closer, shoulder brushing yours\u2014not aggressive, just close enough
    to fit in a selfie frame. She lifts her hand to fix her hair, then pauses."
  - "\u201CActually\u2026 hold on.\u201D "
  - "She reaches behind her to the prep table, grabs a small stack of fry boats,
    and sets them on the counter.  \u201CYou\u2019re taller. Hold the phone. Better
    angle. I\u2019ll pretend I work here and you pretend you don\u2019t hate your
    life.\u201D"
